{
 "about": "The research corpus: the templates researchers start from, across fields, each built by TeX Live's engines (the oracle) and by PhiTeX, the PDFs compared byte for byte: gate-shard.sh's research shard (gate.yml, Lane A: kpathsea over the image's TeX Live) and research-shelf.yml (Lane B: --shelf, Shelf as served). One list for both, and for Shelf's release check. A TeX Live file is copied unchanged under ci/research/<dir>/ (its path under texmf-dist in source.texlive_files); dir may hold several documents' files.",
 "image": "ghcr.io/accl-kaust/phitex-ci:2026-09-25-doc (mc: phitex-ci-2026-09-25.sif): its language collections (CJK, Chinese, Greek, Cyrillic, Hebrew fonts) are not in the base image",
 "texlive": "TeX Live 2026.1 (svn r78408) as the CI image's Arch Linux packages (archive snapshot 2026-09-25), texlive-doc",
 "not_in_texlive": {
  "svjour3, sn-jnl (Springer journals)": "not on CTAN under a TeX Live licence; aomart and amsart stand in for mathematics journals",
  "siamart (SIAM)": "not in TeX Live",
  "iopart (IOP)": "not in TeX Live; mnras and aastex stand in for astronomy, revtex for physics",
  "copernicus (EGU)": "not in TeX Live",
  "neurips, icml, iclr, usenix, aaai": "conference styles distributed by the conferences, not in TeX Live; jmlr [pmlr] stands in"
 },
